    "record": {
     "$type": "app.bsky.feed.post",
     "createdAt": "2026-11-21T06:20:54.865Z",
     "embed": {
      "$type": "app.bsky.embed.images",
      "images": [
       {
        "alt": "Hey @vistaprint - I’d really love to know why my $1400 custom box order was altered by your company after we designed & approved our order.\n\nPicture of our design online VS what I received and now cannot use because CREATURE COMFORTS and USA TODAY BESTSELLING AUTHOR are now illegible.\n\nIt appears it was altered by AI before printing, bypassing my ORIGINAL APPROVAL and design.\n\nI have spent thousands with your company and have recommended you to many other authors for supplies. This is HORRENDOUS…",
        "aspectRatio": {
         "height": 4000,
         "width": 4000
        },
        "image": {
         "$type": "blob",
         "ref": {
          "$link": "bafkreic2fzp4sdpjqdazwdsmuljqdhlje7lpnzpfifmxceequrtrgxwmma"
         },
         "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
         "size": 1949777
        }
       },
       {
        "alt": "Vistaprint called me just now, asking questions about my business and what I’m using the products I bought for, so I quickly cut them off and told them I’d like to focus instead on why they’re using generative AI, consequently ruining customer designs and when I can expect an expedited replacement.\n\nAbsolutely no answers for me other than that I have a “ticket” in the system and it can take 24-48 hours for an update, and that she’d pass along my concerns (as well as all of threads).",
        "aspectRatio": {
         "height": 3859,
         "width": 4000
        },
        "image": {
         "$type": "blob",
         "ref": {
          "$link": "bafkreiftmemu3qd3rmzuzfa32joriw4ydhavvn7e5zr46g6bpowjjkayiu"
         },
         "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
         "size": 1961133
        }
       },
       {
        "alt": "Final update for now on VistaPrint:\n\nA call with corporate was had. I made it clear I’m not just looking for a resolution for myself, but for all of the artists that have had their design garbled by this process of theirs, and to protect future customers.\n\nNow we wait. The ball is in their court.\n\nHave a great weekend, threads family. Thank you for your backing on this and helping ensure they can’t ignore this. Together we can make meaningful change.\n\nLogging off to touch some grass this weekend",
        "aspectRatio": {
         "height": 1765,
         "width": 4000
        },
        "image": {
         "$type": "blob",
         "ref": {
          "$link": "bafkreib56rb2mdamcyhndsnnutp2ntpvegbc6oyjdlyzm6nkly5ywb2b6u"
         },
         "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
         "size": 1140537
        }
       },
       {
        "alt": "Full resolution photo of a delivered custom printed box from VistaPrint showing blatant AI \"upscale\" filtering which has completely mangled most of the text into gibberish and destroyed all of the filigree designs around the corners.",
        "aspectRatio": {
         "height": 4000,
         "width": 3000
        },
        "image": {
         "$type": "blob",
         "ref": {
          "$link": "bafkreidrkune7dtx75o3rq2wmkyyytrlza6ib74vwgh2bmwztksehm6utq"
         },
         "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
         "size": 1864294
        }
       }
      ]
     },
